<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-25T17:08:15.249Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:08:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran special forces have entered Haiti to search for four missing Salvadoran soldiers and four kidnapped aviation technicians after a gang ambush captured them. Haitian gangs carried out the ambush, prompting President Bukele to warn of a harsh response to further attacks. Remains have been found in Haiti, but Bukele says they are not those of the missing Salvadoran personnel. Displacement continues as civilians flee violence in the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ4N2NmMGN4M21RS2E1UlJ3NFBCMlAzcVJxWGxOdDcyRXE3MHluMzJ5ZHhGblNaV3RTSVVLYUpkb2xRdHZJUFVmNW1mQlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8xV2hFc2hQSlNZYlZ6dEJjRHUwS3lWcVdDZUI0VEE3QzZlUjhCSmhKcU5YbUg5TnhUNW9uRXgxYXV3TnQ0ckJ2UkpuMmlnbmFDOUVvMUZBTFNnRFZjNVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPNEhheFZNZ2tfQ1lLWUNHT0c3T29aZ2J1LVhBSmJUczIxNGhSTzFOOUt6M1lPQnZSTnVjaUljQ2w5Rk80UUJ0cndvVzg4ZlJhLU0yUHdNVk9kZld4d2RlbC1WblBPSVRyajlmV1dlMmVXclRxQUZtV2l2ZGluTGhHRDlhNmt2dEx0cW9yd1dB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQRF9KQW1CR1hkUXlEZTFrZFZrUGh4ZjdLTWxlR3p0cElTRnk4WGpzS2JpV2FqX2ktRWJrMmxWT1o1U2swWlRLXy0tRDQ5OFZ0Y2wxUk91eV9RMGVvX3FRU2JUWDVUczk0bjNnek1aQnRJbTNaQnRmZ2ZqdlljRTNyN3hSVmNtZkVlU0lVWGFHNldZSTVST1RlWkFrcUVHclEzay1TYW05R3ExbGQtMkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNOHVwako5bEZBaFBQNmhNQ04zSGxpdHQ5Si1QSkJKWVhU